target:    admin/view/wp-slimstat-db.php
gate:      php tests/goals-args-scope-test.php
kind:      restore-defect
expect:    funnels: no scoped query carries the caller's WHERE
rationale: The funnel twin of D58's minimal form - get_funnels_raw() extracts the WHERE and drops it at the get_funnel_results() call. Without this mutation, reverting the funnel threading would pass every composer gate (the review that added the funnel half of the gate found exactly that hole) and only the on-demand docker cell could notice. Path-prefixed expect pins the funnel assertion, not its goal sibling.
---
--- a/admin/view/wp-slimstat-db.php
+++ b/admin/view/wp-slimstat-db.php
@@ -2699,7 +2699,7 @@
             if (empty($funnel['name']) || empty($funnel['steps'])) {
                 continue;
             }
-            $step_results = self::get_funnel_results($funnel, $extra_where);
+            $step_results = self::get_funnel_results($funnel);
             foreach ($step_results as $i => $step) {
                 $results[] = [
                     'funnel_name' => $funnel['name'],
